      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "**I have exactly the same issue last days!**\n\nOn my play PCs I have **static IP** and **do not use VPNs**. (But use it on other devices)\n\nThis happened at least on two my PCs (one with Win10, other with Win11), but logs below only from one.\n\nI use steam linked acc to **log in using steam**. Generally, **I have 2fa** and using it on other devices.\n\nAll flows seem to be okay, until at some point it just starts to spam **\"Missing Credentials\"** on every API request until VRC restarted.\n\nWhen this happens there is **no errors in UI**, it's just becoming soft locked: no social updates, not able to change avatar or world instance.\n\nWhen VRC restarted, it does **not** ask for new auth or anything, just works until that happens again.\n\nThis is \"floating\" problem: happens on one days and ok on anothers. \n\nMost of the time it **happens when changing avatars**, here the logs below where I am intentionally trying to trigger it in avatar search world.\n\nMy logs (published two files at this moment, I hope I'll upload some more later) 👉 https://gist.github.com/kawashirov/77d516defa5496cf43bc8101e08ae2f4",
